---
// Cartograph mini-map. Thin structural lines. Navy ink.
---

<figure class="cartograph">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 280 196"
    width="280"
    height="196"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Map of Faria Innovations: Parcentry, Flight Risk, and Labs branches."
  >
    <g stroke="#F0EDE4" stroke-width="1" fill="none" stroke-linecap="square">
      <line x1="10" y1="32" x2="10" y2="116" />
      <line x1="10" y1="60" x2="32" y2="60" />
      <line x1="10" y1="88" x2="32" y2="88" />
      <line x1="10" y1="116" x2="32" y2="116" />
      <line x1="48" y1="122" x2="48" y2="180" />
      <line x1="48" y1="138" x2="68" y2="138" />
      <line x1="48" y1="159" x2="68" y2="159" />
      <line x1="48" y1="180" x2="68" y2="180" />
    </g>
    <text x="0" y="22" font-family="'Saira', system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="800" font-style="italic" fill="#F0EDE4">FARIA</text>
    <text x="40" y="64" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#9CA0AB">Parcentry</text>
    <text x="40" y="92" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#9CA0AB">Flight Risk</text>
    <text x="40" y="120" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#9CA0AB">Labs</text>
    <text x="74" y="142" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="10" fill="#7A85A2">archive</text>
    <text x="74" y="163" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="10" fill="#7A85A2">fieldnotes</text>
    <text x="74" y="184" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="10" fill="#7A85A2">cartograph</text>
  </svg>
</figure>
